      "default": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Description",
      "default": "<p>Hair loss drugs, like Finasteride, work by blocking DHT, a hormone tied to hair loss.</p><p>The problem? They don't just block it in your scalp, they block it everywhere. That's why so many men report low libido, erectile issues, and mood swings.</p><p>Hair Rescue works differently. It uses RU58841, a topical DHT blocker that stays local. <strong>It targets the root cause of hair loss, right at the follicle, without ever messing with your sex life.</strong></p>"
    },
